    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d735">

                <pb facs="0829" n="635" xml:id="pg635"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">895.01/7–2145: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 735<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of
                            State to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-21">July 21, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Victory</hi> 167.
                    1. The President has received from Syngman
                        Rhee a telegram<anchor n="1" xml:id="d735-f1"/> requesting
                        Churchill, Stalin and the President to issue a joint
                    statement repudiating any secret agreement that might affect the political,
                    administrative and territorial integrity of Korea, and recognizing “The
                    Provisional Government of Korea”. The telegram requests opportunity for the
                    “Provisional Government” to collaborate in military operations against Japan and
                    gives undertaking to hold national election not later than one year after return
                    to Korea.</p>
                <p>2. Please make acknowledgment to Rhee in
                    such informal manner and in such terms as you may consider appropriate.<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d735-f2"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Byrnes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d735-f1" n="1" xml:id="d735-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d735-f2" n="2" xml:id="d735-f2-content">
                <p>The Acting Secretary of State acknowledged the receipt of Rhee’s telegram on July 24 (file No.
                    895.01/7–2145).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
